msgid "Header и framing"
msgstr "Headers and framing"

msgid ""
"Протокол может хранить длину перед flags или обходиться без идентификатора сообщения. "
"``__header__`` задаёт служебную часть перед полями модели:"
msgstr ""
"A protocol may store the length before the flags or omit the message identifier. ``__header__`` "
"defines the framing that precedes the model fields:"

msgid ""
"from bytespec import Constructor, Flags, PayloadLength, ProtoModel, field\n"
"from bytespec.types import UInt8, VarUInt\n"
"\n"
"class Packet(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __constructor__ = 0x12\n"
"    __header__ = (Constructor(1), PayloadLength(1), Flags(1))\n"
"\n"
"    number: UInt8\n"
"    note: str | None = field(flag=0, prefix_length=1)\n"
"\n"
"packet = Packet(number=7, note=\"A\")\n"
"encoded = packet.encode()\n"
"assert Packet.decode(encoded) == packet\n"
"print(encoded.hex(\" \"))"
msgstr ""
"from bytespec import Constructor, Flags, PayloadLength, ProtoModel, field\n"
"from bytespec.types import UInt8, VarUInt\n"
"\n"
"class Packet(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __constructor__ = 0x12\n"
"    __header__ = (Constructor(1), PayloadLength(1), Flags(1))\n"
"\n"
"    number: UInt8\n"
"    note: str | None = field(flag=0, prefix_length=1)\n"
"\n"
"packet = Packet(number=7, note=\"A\")\n"
"encoded = packet.encode()\n"
"assert Packet.decode(encoded) == packet\n"
"print(encoded.hex(\" \"))"

msgid "12 03 01 07 01 41"
msgstr "12 03 01 07 01 41"

msgid ""
"Здесь ``12`` — constructor, ``03`` — длина **всех полей**, ``01`` — flags. Body занимает три "
"байта: ``07`` и строка ``01 41``. В длину не входит ни один элемент header, даже если "
"``PayloadLength`` стоит перед ``Flags``."
msgstr ""
"Here, ``12`` is the constructor, ``03`` is the length of **all fields**, and ``01`` is the flags "
"bitmap. The body takes three bytes: ``07`` and the string ``01 41``. The length excludes every "
"header element, even when ``PayloadLength`` comes before ``Flags``."

msgid ""
"Без настройки используется ``(Constructor(2), Flags(8), PayloadLength(4))``: 14 байт перед "
"полями. По умолчанию ``__constructor__ = 1`` и ``__byte_order__ = ByteOrder.BIG``."
msgstr ""
"Without customization, the header is ``(Constructor(2), Flags(8), PayloadLength(4))``: 14 bytes "
"before the fields. The defaults are ``__constructor__ = 1`` and ``__byte_order__ = "
"ByteOrder.BIG``."

msgid "Что можно включить в header"
msgstr "Available header elements"

msgid "Элемент"
msgstr "Element"

msgid "Значение"
msgstr "Meaning"

msgid "``Constructor(encoding)``"
msgstr "``Constructor(encoding)``"

msgid "Записывает ``__constructor__`` модели; при чтении сверяет его"
msgstr "Writes the model's ``__constructor__``; checks it when decoding"

msgid "``PayloadLength(encoding)``"
msgstr "``PayloadLength(encoding)``"

msgid "Вычисляет число байтов body; при чтении ограничивает ими поля"
msgstr "Calculates the body length in bytes; bounds field decoding by that length"

msgid "``Flags(encoding)``"
msgstr "``Flags(encoding)``"

msgid "Вычисляет bitmap присутствующих optional-полей по ``field(flag=...)``"
msgstr "Calculates a bitmap of present optional fields based on ``field(flag=...)``"

msgid ""
"``encoding`` — ``1``, ``2``, ``4`` или ``8`` байт без знака, либо аннотация ``VarUInt``. "
"Например, ``Constructor(VarUInt)`` кодирует число 300 как ``ac 02``. ``VarInt``, ``UInt16`` и "
"экземпляр codec вместо этих параметров не поддерживаются. Фиксированные числа используют порядок "
"байтов модели; varint от него не зависит. Те же варианты доступны для всех трёх элементов."
msgstr ""
"``encoding`` is an unsigned width of ``1``, ``2``, ``4``, or ``8`` bytes, or the ``VarUInt`` "
"annotation. For example, ``Constructor(VarUInt)`` encodes 300 as ``ac 02``. ``VarInt``, "
"``UInt16``, and codec instances are not supported as arguments here. Fixed-width numbers use the "
"model's byte order; varints are independent of it. The same options are available for all three "
"elements."

msgid ""
"class CompactPacket(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __constructor__ = 300\n"
"    __header__ = (Constructor(VarUInt), Flags(VarUInt), PayloadLength(VarUInt))\n"
"    number: UInt8\n"
"    note: str | None = field(flag=7, prefix_length=1)\n"
"\n"
"compact = CompactPacket(number=7, note=\"A\")\n"
"assert CompactPacket.decode(compact.encode()) == compact\n"
"print(compact.encode().hex(\" \"))"
msgstr ""
"class CompactPacket(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __constructor__ = 300\n"
"    __header__ = (Constructor(VarUInt), Flags(VarUInt), PayloadLength(VarUInt))\n"
"    number: UInt8\n"
"    note: str | None = field(flag=7, prefix_length=1)\n"
"\n"
"compact = CompactPacket(number=7, note=\"A\")\n"
"assert CompactPacket.decode(compact.encode()) == compact\n"
"print(compact.encode().hex(\" \"))"

msgid "ac 02 80 01 03 07 01 41"
msgstr "ac 02 80 01 03 07 01 41"

msgid ""
"Constructor 300 занимает два байта, bitmap с битом 7 — ещё два, длина body 3 — один. Кодирование "
"unsigned чисел здесь отличается от ``VarInt``, используемого по умолчанию для обычных "
"``int``-полей."
msgstr ""
"Constructor 300 takes two bytes, the bitmap with bit 7 set takes another two, and body length 3 "
"takes one. Unsigned encoding here differs from ``VarInt``, the default for ordinary ``int`` "
"fields."

msgid ""
"Constructor — числовой идентификатор формата, а не вызов Python-конструктора. Библиотека "
"проверяет его только после выбора класса приложением: реестра моделей и автоматического dispatch "
"нет."
msgstr ""
"Constructor is a numeric format identifier, not a call to a Python constructor. The library "
"checks it only after the application has selected a class: there is no model registry or "
"automatic dispatch."

msgid "Изменить порядок"
msgstr "Change the order"

msgid "Переставьте элементы tuple; поля body при этом сохраняют свой порядок:"
msgstr "Reorder the tuple elements; the body fields keep their order:"

msgid ""
"class Reordered(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __constructor__ = 0x12\n"
"    __header__ = (Flags(1), Constructor(1), PayloadLength(VarUInt))\n"
"\n"
"    number: UInt8\n"
"    note: str | None = field(flag=0, prefix_length=1)\n"
"\n"
"packet = Reordered(number=7, note=\"A\")\n"
"assert Reordered.decode(packet.encode()) == packet\n"
"print(packet.encode().hex(\" \"))"
msgstr ""
"class Reordered(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __constructor__ = 0x12\n"
"    __header__ = (Flags(1), Constructor(1), PayloadLength(VarUInt))\n"
"\n"
"    number: UInt8\n"
"    note: str | None = field(flag=0, prefix_length=1)\n"
"\n"
"packet = Reordered(number=7, note=\"A\")\n"
"assert Reordered.decode(packet.encode()) == packet\n"
"print(packet.encode().hex(\" \"))"

msgid "01 12 03 07 01 41"
msgstr "01 12 03 07 01 41"

msgid ""
"Header задаётся при объявлении класса. Менять его элементы и настройки после создания схемы не "
"следует. Правила переиспользования между классами: :doc:`inheritance`."
msgstr ""
"The header is set when the class is declared. Do not change its elements or settings after the "
"schema has been built. For rules on reuse between classes, see :doc:`inheritance`."

msgid "Убрать ненужные элементы"
msgstr "Remove unnecessary elements"

msgid "Если optional-полей нет, bitmap не нужен:"
msgstr "If there are no optional fields, the bitmap is unnecessary:"

msgid ""
"class Reading(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = (Constructor(1), PayloadLength(1))\n"
"    value: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"reading = Reading(value=7)\n"
"assert Reading.decode(reading.encode()) == reading\n"
"print(reading.encode().hex(\" \"))"
msgstr ""
"class Reading(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = (Constructor(1), PayloadLength(1))\n"
"    value: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"reading = Reading(value=7)\n"
"assert Reading.decode(reading.encode()) == reading\n"
"print(reading.encode().hex(\" \"))"

msgid "01 01 07"
msgstr "01 01 07"

msgid ""
"Можно аналогично убрать ``Constructor``: например, ``__header__ = (PayloadLength(2),)`` для "
"обязательных полей, когда тип сообщения уже определён транспортом."
msgstr ""
"You can also omit ``Constructor``: for example, use ``__header__ = (PayloadLength(2),)`` for "
"required fields when the transport already determines the message type."

msgid "Без PayloadLength"
msgstr "Without PayloadLength"

msgid "Если граница сообщения определяется полями, общую длину можно не передавать:"
msgstr "If the fields determine the message boundary, you can omit the overall length:"

msgid ""
"class Reading(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = (Constructor(1),)\n"
"    value: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"buffer = b\"xx\" + Reading(value=7).encode() + Reading(value=8).encode()\n"
"first, end = Reading.decode_from(buffer, 2)\n"
"second, end = Reading.decode_from(buffer, end)\n"
"print(first.value, second.value, end)"
msgstr ""
"class Reading(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = (Constructor(1),)\n"
"    value: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"buffer = b\"xx\" + Reading(value=7).encode() + Reading(value=8).encode()\n"
"first, end = Reading.decode_from(buffer, 2)\n"
"second, end = Reading.decode_from(buffer, end)\n"
"print(first.value, second.value, end)"

msgid "7 8 6"
msgstr "7 8 6"

msgid ""
"``decode_from()`` возвращает конец последнего прочитанного поля. Он больше не пропускает "
"неизвестный хвост body и не знает отдельную границу сообщения: codec видит весь переданный буфер,"
" включая следующее сообщение. Для входа с внешней границей передавайте только разрешённый срез. "
"Проверки собственных размеров полей остаются; ``decode()`` по-прежнему запрещает байты после "
"прочитанных полей. Prefix строки, bytes или списка не исчезает вместе с ``PayloadLength``."
msgstr ""
"``decode_from()`` returns the end of the last field read. It no longer skips an unknown body tail"
" or knows a separate message boundary: the codec sees the entire supplied buffer, including the "
"next message. If the input has an external boundary, pass only the permitted slice. Fields still "
"check their own lengths; ``decode()`` still rejects bytes after the fields it has read. String, "
"bytes, and list prefixes remain even without ``PayloadLength``."

msgid "Вообще без framing"
msgstr "Without any framing"

msgid "Для записи структуры в уже существующий формат задайте пустой tuple:"
msgstr "To write a structure into an existing format, use an empty tuple:"

msgid ""
"from bytespec import ByteOrder\n"
"from bytespec.types import UInt16\n"
"\n"
"class Point(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = ()\n"
"    __byte_order__ = ByteOrder.LITTLE\n"
"    x: UInt16\n"
"    y: UInt16\n"
"\n"
"point = Point(x=1, y=256)\n"
"assert Point.decode(point.encode()) == point\n"
"print(point.encode().hex(\" \"))"
msgstr ""
"from bytespec import ByteOrder\n"
"from bytespec.types import UInt16\n"
"\n"
"class Point(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = ()\n"
"    __byte_order__ = ByteOrder.LITTLE\n"
"    x: UInt16\n"
"    y: UInt16\n"
"\n"
"point = Point(x=1, y=256)\n"
"assert Point.decode(point.encode()) == point\n"
"print(point.encode().hex(\" \"))"

msgid "01 00 00 01"
msgstr "01 00 00 01"

msgid ""
"Здесь ровно четыре байта полей. Модели без полей тоже поддерживаются: например, "
"сообщение-подтверждение может содержать только framing."
msgstr ""
"This produces exactly four bytes of field data. Models without fields are also supported: for "
"example, an acknowledgment message can contain only framing."

msgid ""
"class Ack(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __constructor__ = 0x12\n"
"    __header__ = (Constructor(1), PayloadLength(1))\n"
"\n"
"class Empty(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = ()\n"
"\n"
"assert Ack.decode(Ack().encode()) == Ack()\n"
"assert Empty.decode(b\"\") == Empty()\n"
"print(Ack().encode().hex(\" \"))\n"
"print(Empty().encode())"
msgstr ""
"class Ack(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __constructor__ = 0x12\n"
"    __header__ = (Constructor(1), PayloadLength(1))\n"
"\n"
"class Empty(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = ()\n"
"\n"
"assert Ack.decode(Ack().encode()) == Ack()\n"
"assert Empty.decode(b\"\") == Empty()\n"
"print(Ack().encode().hex(\" \"))\n"
"print(Empty().encode())"

msgid ""
"12 00\n"
"b''"
msgstr ""
"12 00\n"
"b''"

msgid ""
"``Ack`` записывает constructor и нулевую длину body. ``Empty`` без полей и header записывает "
"пустые bytes. Такой объект не подходит для элемента списка: по нулю байтов нельзя восстановить "
"количество элементов (см. :ref:`codec-contract`)."
msgstr ""
"``Ack`` writes the constructor and a zero body length. ``Empty``, with neither fields nor a "
"header, writes empty bytes. Such an object is unsuitable as a list element: zero bytes cannot "
"convey the number of elements (see :ref:`codec-contract`)."

msgid "Как записывается header вложенной модели"
msgstr "How nested model headers are written"

msgid ""
"Вложенная модель использует свой порядок байтов и свой ``__header__``, но её ``Constructor`` "
"автоматически пропускается: тип уже известен из аннотации поля. Остальные элементы остаются в "
"указанном порядке:"
msgstr ""
"A nested model uses its own byte order and ``__header__``, but its ``Constructor`` is "
"automatically skipped: the field annotation already specifies the type. The remaining elements "
"keep their declared order:"

msgid ""
"from bytespec import ByteOrder, Constructor, Flags, PayloadLength\n"
"from bytespec.types import UInt8, UInt16\n"
"\n"
"class Reading(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __constructor__ = 0x34\n"
"    __byte_order__ = ByteOrder.LITTLE\n"
"    __header__ = (PayloadLength(1), Constructor(1), Flags(1))\n"
"    value: UInt16\n"
"\n"
"class Frame(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = ()\n"
"    reading: Reading\n"
"    tail: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"reading = Reading(value=0x1234)\n"
"frame = Frame(reading=reading, tail=9)\n"
"assert Frame.decode(frame.encode()) == frame\n"
"print(reading.encode().hex(\" \"))\n"
"print(frame.encode().hex(\" \"))"
msgstr ""
"from bytespec import ByteOrder, Constructor, Flags, PayloadLength\n"
"from bytespec.types import UInt8, UInt16\n"
"\n"
"class Reading(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __constructor__ = 0x34\n"
"    __byte_order__ = ByteOrder.LITTLE\n"
"    __header__ = (PayloadLength(1), Constructor(1), Flags(1))\n"
"    value: UInt16\n"
"\n"
"class Frame(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = ()\n"
"    reading: Reading\n"
"    tail: UInt8\n"
"\n"
"reading = Reading(value=0x1234)\n"
"frame = Frame(reading=reading, tail=9)\n"
"assert Frame.decode(frame.encode()) == frame\n"
"print(reading.encode().hex(\" \"))\n"
"print(frame.encode().hex(\" \"))"

msgid ""
"02 34 00 34 12\n"
"02 00 34 12 09"
msgstr ""
"02 34 00 34 12\n"
"02 00 34 12 09"

msgid ""
"Отдельная запись: длина ``02``, constructor ``34``, flags ``00``, value ``34 12``. Во вложенной "
"записи отсутствует только constructor; ``09`` — следующее поле внешней модели. Пустой header "
"внешнего класса не убирает framing вложенного. При стандартных настройках вложенный header "
"занимает 12 байт: 8 байт flags и 4 байта длины."
msgstr ""
"Standalone encoding: length ``02``, constructor ``34``, flags ``00``, value ``34 12``. Nested "
"encoding omits only the constructor; ``09`` is the next field of the outer model. An empty header"
" on the outer class does not remove the nested model's framing. With the default settings, a "
"nested header takes 12 bytes: 8 bytes of flags and 4 bytes of length."

msgid "Для ``list[Reading]`` действует то же правило:"
msgstr "The same rule applies to ``list[Reading]``:"

msgid ""
"class Batch(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = ()\n"
"    readings: list[Reading] = field(prefix_length=1)\n"
"\n"
"batch = Batch(readings=[reading])\n"
"assert Batch.decode(batch.encode()) == batch\n"
"print(batch.encode().hex(\" \"))"
msgstr ""
"class Batch(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = ()\n"
"    readings: list[Reading] = field(prefix_length=1)\n"
"\n"
"batch = Batch(readings=[reading])\n"
"assert Batch.decode(batch.encode()) == batch\n"
"print(batch.encode().hex(\" \"))"

msgid "04 02 00 34 12"
msgstr "04 02 00 34 12"

msgid ""
"``04`` — размер закодированного элемента вместе с оставшимся framing. Вложенный ``__header__ = "
"()`` убирает и его; пример структурных полей ``ver/cmd/opcode/seq`` показан ниже. Собственные "
"правила длины вложенной модели сохраняются; без ``PayloadLength`` конец определяется её "
"известными полями."
msgstr ""
"``04`` is the encoded element size, including its remaining framing. Setting ``__header__ = ()`` "
"on the nested model removes that framing too; an example with structural fields "
"``ver/cmd/opcode/seq`` appears below. The nested model retains its own length rules; without "
"``PayloadLength``, its known fields determine its end."

msgid "Данные протокола остаются полями"
msgstr "Protocol data stays in fields"

msgid ""
"``ver``, ``cmd``, ``opcode`` и ``seq`` — значения приложения, а не вычисляемое framing. Вынесите "
"их в обычную вложенную модель:"
msgstr ""
"``ver``, ``cmd``, ``opcode``, and ``seq`` are application values, not computed framing. Put them "
"in a regular nested model:"

msgid ""
"class Header(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = ()\n"
"    ver: UInt8\n"
"    cmd: UInt8\n"
"    opcode: UInt16\n"
"    seq: UInt16\n"
"\n"
"class Envelope(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = (PayloadLength(2),)\n"
"    header: Header\n"
"    payload: bytes = field(prefix_length=1)\n"
"\n"
"packet = Envelope(header=Header(ver=1, cmd=2, opcode=18, seq=22), payload=b\"OK\")\n"
"assert Envelope.decode(packet.encode()) == packet\n"
"print(packet.encode().hex(\" \"))"
msgstr ""
"class Header(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = ()\n"
"    ver: UInt8\n"
"    cmd: UInt8\n"
"    opcode: UInt16\n"
"    seq: UInt16\n"
"\n"
"class Envelope(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = (PayloadLength(2),)\n"
"    header: Header\n"
"    payload: bytes = field(prefix_length=1)\n"
"\n"
"packet = Envelope(header=Header(ver=1, cmd=2, opcode=18, seq=22), payload=b\"OK\")\n"
"assert Envelope.decode(packet.encode()) == packet\n"
"print(packet.encode().hex(\" \"))"

msgid "00 09 01 02 00 12 00 16 02 4f 4b"
msgstr "00 09 01 02 00 12 00 16 02 4f 4b"

msgid ""
"``00 09`` — длина body; дальше шесть байтов ``Header``, затем ``02 4f 4b`` — bytes с собственным "
"префиксом. Объект ``packet.header`` содержит данные приложения; ``Envelope.__header__`` описывает"
" framing. Вложенная модель сохраняет свой header **без Constructor**: точный пример — :ref"
":`nested-headers`."
msgstr ""
"``00 09`` is the body length, followed by six bytes of ``Header``, then ``02 4f 4b``: bytes with "
"their own prefix. The ``packet.header`` object holds application data; ``Envelope.__header__`` "
"describes framing. The nested model keeps its header **without Constructor**: see :ref:`nested-"
"headers` for an exact example."

msgid "Что проверяется в 0.1.0"
msgstr "What is checked in 0.1.0"

msgid ""
"При создании элемента проверяется поддерживаемое ``encoding``. При сборке модели ``Constructor`` "
"требует обычный ``int`` (не ``bool``), а ``Flags`` проверяет вместимость bitmap. Например, бит 8 "
"не помещается в один байт:"
msgstr ""
"Creating an element checks that its ``encoding`` is supported. When the model is built, "
"``Constructor`` requires an ordinary ``int`` (not ``bool``), and ``Flags`` checks the bitmap "
"capacity. For example, bit 8 does not fit in one byte:"

msgid ""
"from bytespec import SchemaError\n"
"\n"
"try:\n"
"    class TooManyFlags(ProtoModel):\n"
"        __header__ = (Flags(1),)\n"
"        note: str | None = field(flag=8)\n"
"except SchemaError as error:\n"
"    print(error)"
msgstr ""
"from bytespec import SchemaError\n"
"\n"
"try:\n"
"    class TooManyFlags(ProtoModel):\n"
"        __header__ = (Flags(1),)\n"
"        note: str | None = field(flag=8)\n"
"except SchemaError as error:\n"
"    print(error)"

msgid "Flags encoding provides 8 bits, model has field with flag 8"
msgstr "Flags encoding provides 8 bits, model has field with flag 8"

msgid ""
"Номера flags всегда ограничены 0–63, в том числе для ``Flags(VarUInt)``. Диапазон самого "
"constructor проверяется при **encode**, с ``EncodeError``; неверный constructor в сообщении даёт "
"``DecodeError``."
msgstr ""
"Flag numbers are always limited to 0–63, including with ``Flags(VarUInt)``. The constructor's own"
" range is checked during **encode**, raising ``EncodeError``; an incorrect constructor in a "
"message raises ``DecodeError``."

msgid ""
"Для optional-полей требуется ``Flags`` в итоговом header. Это проверяется при объявлении класса, "
"в том числе для унаследованных полей:"
msgstr ""
"Optional fields require ``Flags`` in the final header. This is checked when the class is "
"declared, including for inherited fields:"

msgid ""
"try:\n"
"    class MissingFlags(ProtoModel):\n"
"        __header__ = (PayloadLength(1),)\n"
"        note: str | None = field(flag=0)\n"
"except SchemaError as error:\n"
"    print(error)\n"
"\n"
"class WithFlags(ProtoModel):\n"
"    __header__ = (Flags(1), PayloadLength(1))\n"
"    note: str | None = field(flag=0)\n"
"\n"
"try:\n"
"    class WithoutFlags(WithFlags):\n"
"        __header__ = (PayloadLength(1),)\n"
"except SchemaError as error:\n"
"    print(error)"
